<h3><a href="/blog/what-a-sitemap-does/">What a sitemap does, and what it does not</a></h3>
<p class="lc-excerpt">A sitemap lists the pages you want search engines to know about. It helps them find pages, but it does not make a page rank.</p>
</article>
